  "question": {
    "text": "In a series LCR resonant circuit, the quality factor is measured as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math>. If the inductance is increased by two fold and resistance is decreased by two fold, then the quality factor after this change will be _______"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "282.84",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mrow><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msqrt><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mn>100</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>282</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>84</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
